- evidence: evidence/baseline/source-bindings.json, preservation.json, index-entries.z and candidate.json; baseline HEAD 5046858826f3bca7922c14ef402b095feca8b6fb. Existing intended source hashes match the approved baseline and staged entries plus five foreign files are unchanged. Isolated clone has the same HEAD.
- current_coverage: shared input contract, selector parser, report evaluator, command descriptors, immutable presentation catalog/document validation and approval writer already exist. Codex projection and sequential hints are partially covered only by retained study evidence.
